{
  "$comment": [
    "editorconfig-checker configuration, used by super-linter (VALIDATE_EDITORCONFIG).",
    "",
    "Only the indent-size sub-check is disabled, and only because it cannot model",
    "continuation lines. It requires every line's left padding to be a multiple of",
    "indent_size, which flags three constructs that are correct and deliberate:",
    "",
    "  - wrapped CSS declarations aligned under the property they continue",
    "    (src/lib/docs.ts),",
    "  - continuation text in ordered lists, indented three spaces to align with",
    "    the item text (CONTRIBUTING.md, RESEARCH.md, paper/paper.md),",
    "  - shell arguments aligned under a backslash continuation (workflows).",
    "",
    "Every other editorconfig rule stays enforced: charset, final newline,",
    "trailing whitespace, line endings and indent style. Actual indentation is",
    "enforced for TypeScript by Prettier, which runs in CI and pre-commit."
  ],
  "Exclude": ["^data/", "^coverage/", "^dist/", "^node_modules/", "package-lock\\.json$"],
  "Disable": {
    "IndentSize": true
  }
}
